I have updated the umoria 4.87 sources on ucbarpa.Berkeley.EDU.
You can either ftp the moria487.tar.Z.a* files, or, if you already have
umoria 4.87 sources, you can just ftp the patch file u487.p3 which is
about 50k.

The "no light when run stops because of hunger" problem has been fixed.
Also, there is a untested patch file included which should enable
umoria to compile on machines with 16 bit integers.

I do not consider the sources to be a beta release anymore.
I have sent a copy of the sources (including all three patches) to the
comp.sources.games moderator.  It should appear there within a week or two.




